%% alt: A caller enqueues work and gets a job ID back. Rate-limited workers take jobs from the queue, call the model API with retries using backoff and jitter, and save checkpoints and results; the caller collects results by webhook or by polling.
flowchart LR
  C[Caller]:::human -->|enqueue,<br/>get job ID| Q[(Queue)]:::data
  Q --> W[Workers<br/>rate-limited]:::tool
  W -->|retry, backoff + jitter| M[Model API]:::model
  W --> S[(Checkpoints<br/>and results)]:::data
  S -.->|webhook or poll| C
